<title>UK: Deutsche Bau-und Bodenbank sets mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bau-und Bodenbank sets mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BAU- UND BODENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    27.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     10 BP     PAY DATE    27.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.13    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	INHABERSCHULDVERSCHREIBUNG AUSGABE 42</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
